+ * this port needs, and the names on the left are the *actions*, which do not change when a
+ * future upstream renumbers a button.
+ *
+ * The bindings are read from the same `CONFIG_JOYSTICK_*` values the play state tests
+ * (`ball/st_play.c:548-566`, `:92`), rather than written out as prose, so a card that disagrees
+ * with the game is not possible.
